#: badend:badend_426E9937_1441_47ED_B630_0214FA99B000
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48686731e325d4fe5e97ad29c54392196a5816109b477e10f7bb69272de251f6
#. default-sha256: 69abe4ae41ecc404528071c06b1a43f13de2f46581e30a99c066de15ee3ab207
msgctxt "badend:badend_426E9937_1441_47ED_B630_0214FA99B000"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫She was absolutely right."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫――彼女の言葉は、⟪k:21⟫もっともだ。"

#: badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6d65b8c875721a63393d9f74b802b019fc20f3d1f4b4b113ad100c8602131b0
#. default-sha256: 42e94adb100c36eb94bab06f18eb8f5320d2dc77cfdfac18cbb82b9a594d143a
msgctxt "badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had seen an excess of tragedy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」はここに至るまで、⟪k:5⟫あまりにも多くの悲劇を目にし過ぎた。"

#: badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09e41829abb83895ea0854181087bd6171fa12e79ba2ead8e1fa0d6b5fc84c39
#. default-sha256: db9666230cbe4fb2047f1a6b35c03a374e409921d0546d2a5bebcd578ffd7f04
msgctxt "badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had borne witness to far too much pain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あまりにも多くの心の痛みを、⟪k:1⟫目の当たりにしてきた。"

#: badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 679af73d2173f7644147a20a7d03b135473b0ad081a1b6e7921ed46e8e58fc16
#. default-sha256: 07d01e7af2f928d157562b6e45e4fd5ee9d2f90df37eaf1abfb19968d586174c
msgctxt "badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫his⟪k:3⟫ spirit was deeply wounded by it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」の心は深く傷ついている……。"

#: badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0659b9d2b261945cd18b9a9fc8f908cda3414d4a299ea5077e62a102ac8f7328
#. default-sha256: 7718bdac4bac7ad363d284740bc67b8cf325e82cddff08afa19db22af0e0a649
msgctxt "badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ could not possibly endure any further tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫これ以上の悲劇など、⟪k:1⟫耐えられそうもない。"

#: badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e4ef0a08c611a739eebfa9becbd93ea2b7a30059773cae8e686a7b5ad671063
#. default-sha256: 5bf9108d29c4d7768ccf40aa1e62788ab47aa7394b582a054b1aca7c1abfda59
msgctxt "badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And so, if she was offering ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ relief from all that, perhaps ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫"
"he⟪k:6⟫ should accept it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから……⟪k:1⟫彼女が守ってくれるというのならば、⟪k:2⟫それに従った方が良いだろう。"

#: badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d69f134aff8cd10b610983f92e4f520c5c85013be0e68a03191af5f951db13db
#. default-sha256: 3c6921ebe98bedfd64d575a6d546444543fe0dfd0f719c7d22e958e62aa23cbe
msgctxt "badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had guided ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ this far, never letting go of ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ここまで、⟪k:1⟫彼女は「⟪k:2⟫あなた⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」を導き続けてくれた。"

#: badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a00c55e5748762f65ee7dcdb1bfdb51eef80b627a1c89ea6801bad0bfbec0bd0
#. default-sha256: bbda836b3aa70f3669559d59fb56036fe4c1dc9088eec7e5b1b32690fb986ab8
msgctxt "badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it was her presence that had allowed ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ to bear the bleak, "
"disheartening, and wretched tales ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫he⟪k:6⟫ saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫時に憂鬱で、⟪k:1⟫時に陰惨で、⟪k:2⟫時にむごたらしい物語が目の前にあった時も、⟪k:3⟫彼女が手を繋"
"いでいてくれたからこそ、⟪k:4⟫ここまで来れたのだろう。"

#: badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 738b0b290b5ab463c28ef09a652f75a0737e9c36f26d143b3df7d991d6ec382b
#. default-sha256: b81cd740a06121c39e5a9fdfab5afe779d8f1e7ccb3beb99dd7751926625ddf2
msgctxt "badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ really need anything other than her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もはや、⟪k:1⟫「⟪k:2⟫あなた⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」にとって、⟪k:6⟫彼女以外に必要なものはないので"
"はないか。"

#: badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5f5ef0061e008beffd16fe207da662099583affaf17b6d5a3b839fddfb0a18d
#. default-sha256: 8241457973851f4b326a9dc5eaa6b3f451509be2f2aa52ac2669386a52d36b48
msgctxt "badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If she said she wanted to be with ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女が「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」を望むというのならば……"

#: badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 553f391f702b373224ac194b46ed7d5dab0c92ec6b840848ffc4c1a23d2c412b
#. default-sha256: a4084a95a8bf0766e126733d38849299da7d7e5a6c9adbf37bb493b265bdccff
msgctxt "badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ allowed to want the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」も彼女を望んでいいのではないか。"

#: badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68167ea53714ab9d3a2b75a0a22d9b6b38b5d2c7864ea4a0241b4999d890336f
#. default-sha256: d856b1c1881357257aa4d695b0834068d032187dc8baba47fce869ce08cc83c0
msgctxt "badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Grasp my hand, Master...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Come, hold it tight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫さあ、⟪k:3⟫旦那さま……。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫わたくしの手を……⟪k:6⟫握り返してくださいまし。"

#: badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96d981f40079ecf3bcfe98622a71104375242ae425a01fbcff5971918f4add1c
#. default-sha256: bdd8bd3a7c5640cb5b250a0c9c486691f82e12dde6f9ccaaf7230c55db524d6a
msgctxt "badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ gently wrapped ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ fingers around the "
"Maid’s cold hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」は女中の冷たい手を、⟪k:5⟫やわらかく包み込んだ。"

#: badend:badend_C2FB14B1_07D8_4207_929D_EC8C5B7A68BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4ca78c40db0fad240ad786a6c0e2be3329c1194b257567b7b133a3e301103bc
#. default-sha256: 26e15af1de764a059024d267c72519f4c06a70b56434fba4553251e4e11c2ba3
msgctxt "badend:badend_C2FB14B1_07D8_4207_929D_EC8C5B7A68BD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to let go."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう……⟪k:1⟫この手を離すことはないだろう。"

#: badend:badend_BAE7E41B_D276_4CB9_A2B2_44C4AA1DC088
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5f3f49b802e447fc5c437bebbcf5893ad62124b78f0c93ba6ec0f0c7b278c77
#. default-sha256: 12c70cb1e2c858df6bc4eb945ce4dd81d51e6cc302ebdab27b7f118423616c51
msgctxt "badend:badend_BAE7E41B_D276_4CB9_A2B2_44C4AA1DC088"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう……⟪k:1⟫何も思い出すことはないだろう。"

#: badend:badend_74649044_6D3B_42E9_91BB_EC8BBFACE885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87c569d927116412816d7447267b5b280c1290f14fcf610b9b06157dceb3a8c7
#. default-sha256: 8f1883f2761e02bd1d87085fdd11cb5153e98c9beb005d8cf2ea8263abecd1c5
msgctxt "badend:badend_74649044_6D3B_42E9_91BB_EC8BBFACE885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Never again to look back upon the past ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ might have had,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫かつて過ぎ去ったはずの、⟪k:1⟫ひとかけら程の幸福な日々も。"

#: badend:badend_EAA90AAE_67A8_4496_8BA6_AE73C80B00D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07c0932898481f7d04da55239ec97c70277cdc4998271bc917431e8f7d50f3b6
#. default-sha256: 3fd8851dd64d9d6dccabf1d88667367089ba69fa0f572c3be12a6fd21fe830b5
msgctxt "badend:badend_EAA90AAE_67A8_4496_8BA6_AE73C80B00D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the rare, treasured days of happiness,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫かつて過ぎ去ったはずの、⟪k:1⟫傷に満ちた辛い日々も。"

#: badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01bc328f6f6002cf71425d3fd717f8977de1bd290bc197186b119f63add232e8
#. default-sha256: 3e4691a843261b1b278423821461838c1ce995956f5ffaa4320a96d0726c63ed
msgctxt "badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the bitter days filled with nothing but pain,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫「⟪k:2⟫あなた⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」が見つけなければいけなかった人も――"

#: badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41c1616cb221f8bcde21c728218a20906296ea83d86c1674847ba1b45c322943
#. default-sha256: 7436311944a5eca3572d38a3765afb4114e421b5cfaf7f121e8c8386834f5619
msgctxt "badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the person ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ supposed to find."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫思い出すことはない。"

#: badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b70d4829e483cffb1ab16c98b74f2bc527a7df03e29a352128e564640956be28
#. default-sha256: a6019ed03446ed332d1490e72f6049c84b1ad6f2a084ec179c31dab1300d360e
msgctxt "badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ fine with that. ⟪k:4⟫There was no one to criticize ⟪k:5⟫"
"You⟪k:6⟫him⟪k:7⟫ for averting ⟪k:8⟫Your⟪k:9⟫his⟪k:10⟫ eyes from ⟪k:11⟫Your⟪k:12⟫his⟪k:13⟫ pain "
"and seizing the opportunity for happiness lying before ⟪k:14⟫You⟪k:15⟫him⟪k:16⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど……、⟪k:1⟫それでいい。⟪k:2⟫辛いことに目を背け、⟪k:3⟫今ある幸福を手にしようとする「⟪k:4⟫"
"あなた⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者⟪k:7⟫」を、⟪k:8⟫責める者はいない。"

#: badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1dd228ad1aace2988910c92d9298be4f07c9c4e915f80446b4535b1498f64fc
#. default-sha256: 07d002aa449ec113f3e5b0d8ce6be7dfc4f47b82c616f149f85adc8540b16fb1
msgctxt "badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ made the correct choice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」は正しい選択をしたのだ……。"

#: badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8112c0ccb92bba587faca9624584a32189d8ba04ac926e51e96e0c68d829f419
#. default-sha256: 057386f57f2f68e1103f15d6edc8fc37a43c5b441fc5dd076ae0913966e9509b
msgctxt "badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Master... ⟪k:14⟫Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫\t⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫\t⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫旦那さま……、⟪k:14⟫旦"
"那さま。"

#: badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49380068008c36b15fe16e966f7036e4f0e388f6d3294d0a4439eb950cddcce2
#. default-sha256: 08bc3615cadaccff9ccad311ec311e8c2f5960af11f8b6efc9a8854c9f88cd20
msgctxt "badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, thank goodness. You have awoken.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was getting worried there for a moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あら……⟪k:2⟫やっとお目覚めになられたのですね。⟪k:3⟫なかなか起きなかったものですから、"
"⟪k:4⟫わたくし、⟪k:5⟫どうしようかと。"

#: badend:badend_9DC2F38C_144D_445D_AC6E_F7CB12141173
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
